Label peoplepanel/addname
Add a name

Label peoplepanel/status_label
Select a folder to display faces

Label peoplepanel/ignore
Ignore

Label peoplepanel/manual_add
Add a person manually

Label peoplepanel/manual_cancel
Cancel

Text1 peoplepanel/instructions
As Picasa scans your photos, the faces it finds are automatically grouped for easy naming.\n\nThings to know:\n\nTo identify a person, click 'Add a name', then type in the person's name and press Enter.  A new People album will be created each time you name someone for the first time.\n\n(TIP: Sign in with your Google Account to gain access to all of your contacts while naming.)\n\nTo ignore a person, click the 'X' button on the face thumbnail.\n\nSuggestions: After you name someone, Picasa may suggest more matching faces for that person. Click on a person's album to view and confirm (or reject) any suggestions.

